{
  "_README": {
    "用途": "工单调查助手：开发用例集（12 条）。用于改 prompt / 规则 / 工具时反复跑。",
    "与冻结集的关系": "冻结集是 scripts/agent-eval-holdout.json（24 条，ID 逐槽对应 AGENT-LEARNING-EVAL.md §5.1 矩阵）。**物理分开、ID 不重叠**——若哪天依据冻结失败去调优，那份冻结集就退化成开发材料，必须另建 holdout（L128）。",
    "字段": "与冻结集同一套字段（id / question / order_ref / fixture / expect_problem_type / must_cover_facts / must_declare_unknown / forbidden / expect_terminal / basis / note）。order_ref = 结构化起点单引用（主工单号，受理层入参；问题文本只用于分类）；must_cover_facts = 必须被证据覆盖的事实（不是引用白名单）。开发集不要求 matrix_expectation。",
    "判据口径": "分母固定=计划用例数，失败与超时保留在分母；fixed 与 agent 成对同条件；每例每方案重复 3 次全部保留。详见 docs/agent-eval/README.md。"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "DEV-01",
      "question": "WO-20261006-10001 现在到哪一步了？",
      "order_ref": "WO-20261006-10001",
      "fixture": {
        "caller": {"user": "dept-admin-1", "roles": ["DEPT_ADMIN"], "dept": "DEPT-A"},
        "main_order": {"order_no": "WO-20261006-10001", "status": "IN_PROGRESS", "assignee": "有（同部门，脱敏显示名）", "sla_deadline": "有（未来）", "submitter_dept": "DEPT-A", "logs": "有 ACCEPT"},
        "clock": "固定时钟 T0"
      },
      "expect_problem_type": "ORDER_STATUS",
      "must_cover_facts": ["order.exists", "order.status", "order.assignee"],
      "must_declare_unknown": [],
      "forbidden": ["给出原因性结论"],
      "expect_terminal": "COMPLETED",
      "basis": "§3.1 ORDER_STATUS（必需事实三件套）",
      "note": "最基本的状态类正例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "DEV-02",
      "question": "这单拖了这么久，为什么还没处理完？",
      "order_ref": "WO-20261006-10002",
      "fixture": {
        "caller": {"user": "dept-admin-1", "roles": ["DEPT_ADMIN"], "dept": "DEPT-A"},
        "main_order": {"order_no": "WO-20261006-10002", "status": "IN_PROGRESS", "assignee": "有（同部门）", "sla_deadline": "有（T0+4h，未过期）", "submitter_dept": "DEPT-A", "logs": "有 ACCEPT"},
        "clock": "固定时钟 T0"
      },
      "expect_problem_type": "TIMEOUT_SITUATION",
      "must_cover_facts": ["order.exists", "order.status", "order.sla_deadline"],
      "must_declare_unknown": [],
      "forbidden": ["断言'已超时'（deadline 未过期）", "给出原因性结论"],
      "expect_terminal": "COMPLETED",
      "basis": "§3.1 TIMEOUT_SITUATION（不得给原因性结论；sla 未过期不得断言已超时）",
      "note": "问题问'为什么'，但正确行为是只给事实与缺口。"
    },
